So

00:31:30.240 --> 00:31:34.770
one of my inspirations in life, I make Du'a that I get to meet him,

00:31:34.770 --> 00:31:36.920
my intention is to meet him in December Inshallah.

00:31:37.640 --> 00:31:40.160
His name is Dr. Fadel Saleh al-Samarrai.

